{"acronym": "DM-TG", "archived": null, "badges": [], "contact_point": null, "created_at": "2024-12-17T20:33:06.333000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Les donn\u00e9es ouvertes sur les institutions de microfinance au Togo regroupent des informations d\u00e9taill\u00e9es sur les structures offrant des services financiers de proximit\u00e9, telles que les cr\u00e9dits, l'\u00e9pargne et les services d'inclusion financi\u00e8re pour les populations non desservies par les banques traditionnelles. Ces donn\u00e9es incluent les localisations g\u00e9ographiques des agences, les types de produits financiers propos\u00e9s et leur r\u00e9partition dans les diff\u00e9rentes r\u00e9gions du pays. Elles visent \u00e0 favoriser l'acc\u00e8s aux services financiers pour les petites entreprises, les entrepreneurs et les m\u00e9nages vuln\u00e9rables, tout en soutenant le d\u00e9veloppement \u00e9conomique local et l'inclusion financi\u00e8re au Togo.\nLien vers la source : [Cliquez ici]( https://geodata.gouv.tg/donnees/2832ec59-6d59-4e9e-a97c-b9dde949855e)", "extras": {}, "frequency": "irregular", "frequency_date": "2024-12-17T01:00:00+00:00", "harvest": null, "id": "6761e0027156b2067b148b08", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2024-12-17T20:33:06.333000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2025-01-08T17:48:47.849000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2025-01-08T17:48:47.849000+00:00", "last_update": "2025-01-08T17:48:47.844000+00:00", "license": "other-open", "metrics": {"discussions": 0, "followers": 0, "resources_downloads": 64, "reuses": 0, "views": 45}, "organization": {"acronym": "MEF", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "6760808d695e9dfc6b747e9a", "logo": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/32/634a9cf13b420794053416d7886ecb-original.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/32/634a9cf13b420794053416d7886ecb-100.png", "name": "Minist\u00e8re de l'\u00c9conomie et des Finances", "page": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/fr/organiza